{"id":"618dc6ad8d6c1e22","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Recursively Enumerable Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set — ZFC Recursion3 Recursively Enumerable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set — ZFC Recursion3 Recursively Enumerable Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set — ZFC Recursion3 Recursively Enumerable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set\">58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\)</span> (canonical c.e.-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Recursively enumerable” is a legacy synonym for the canonical computably enumerable predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"7b1ff54ac76ee59d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(A)","display":true}],"bytes":1003,"backlinks":[{"id":"08babcd57560d642","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4336312c6be144dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"829cdce84f5ea469","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"92fa434114fb3